## 10. Future-Proofing

- Add image/video upload later: reserved field `heroMedia` but hidden.
- More criteria: array-driven Step 2; Step 3 dynamically renders contribution widgets.
- Draft autosave & resume link.
- Collaboration: allow multiple creators to co-manage a draft.

